# UBE2M KD — KEGG_2019_Mouse GSEA: execution status and artifacts

**Question**: most significantly enriched KEGG_2019_Mouse pathway (GSEApy) in the
UBE2M knockdown model; DEG = baseMean>10 -> raw p<0.05 -> |log2FC raw|>1, then
DESeq2-style log2FC shrinkage.

## Answer status
**GSEA could NOT be executed in this environment -> no pathway can be reported.**
Both hard prerequisites failed and were re-attempted inside the executed script:
1. `gseapy` / `pydeseq2` are not installed and cannot be installed (no network:
   DNS resolution fails; `pip`, Enrichr, mygene.info all unreachable; no R).
2. `KEGG_2019_Mouse` GMT is only obtainable from Enrichr (unreachable) and no local
